[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 38821.11, "timestamp": "10:47:01", "text": "我心想：是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38824.23, "timestamp": "10:47:04", "text": "我們走吧。  這是哪裡？這邊。  我错过了电梯。这东西会发射。  是的，那东西会发射。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38830.47, "timestamp": "10:47:10", "text": "你根本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38851.03, "timestamp": "10:47:31", "text": "没做过。解开谜题了吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38857.03, "timestamp": "10:47:37", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38865.11, "timestamp": "10:47:45", "text": "不，我每次都是走最难的路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38868.15, "timestamp": "10:47:48", "text": "我的天啊。  是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38874.746, "timestamp": "10:47:54", "text": "你可以這樣做。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38877.906, "timestamp": "10:47:57", "text": "不是認真的吧？我討厭一切。  等等，Clea是什么？哦，呃，是奥辛的克莉娅。好的，明白了。砰。  猛擊。  你知道，"}]